          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "We learned about different 3D solids. Identify and list objects or structures around you that are cubical, cuboidal, cylindrical, conical, spherical, or pyramidal in shape, or closely resemble these shapes."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.351,
            0.881,
            0.409
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Activity:",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " Find the approximate volumes of a gas cylinder, a bucket, any cylindrical vessel, a cupboard, a water tank that you can find near you (use 1000 cm"
